<title>LEBANON: BANQUE AUDI ISSUES Q1 RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BANQUE AUDI ISSUES Q1 RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Audi issued on Tuesday unaudited consolidated financial results for the first three months of 1997 (in millions of Lebanese pounds):</p>
<p>			   Q1 (1997)	    1996</p>
<p>						 (full year)</p>
<p>    Net profits	  8,024		30,714</p>
<p>    Assets	   3,020,274	   2,862,729</p>
<p>    Deposits	 2,553,038	   2,393,225</p>
<p>    loans		865,896	     814,037</p>
<p>Banque Audi did not issue comparative figures for the first quarter of 1996. It was the first time the bank has issued quarterly results.</p>
<p>$1 = 1,543.75</p>
<p>- Beirut editorial (9611) 602057 645308</p>
</text>
